SELECT c."id", 'Using It Safely', $md$Four rules that keep your customers, your money, and your name protected.$md$, $md$Four rules:

1. Never paste in what you wouldn’t put on a postcard — no customer data, banking info, or passwords.
2. Verify anything that matters against a real source. AI is not your lawyer or accountant.
3. Never send AI-written text you haven’t read, because it goes out under your name.
4. Never pass along unchecked AI “facts” in applications or client documents.

## Do this now

Ask AI a factual question about your industry, then verify its answer against a real source — notice what it got right and wrong.$md$, NULL, true, 4
