SELECT c."id", 'Chart of Accounts', $md$The category list your money sorts into. Keep it short.$md$, $md$It’s just the category list your money sorts into. Keep it short — 10–15 expense categories that match how your business actually works. The test: do report lines answer questions you’d actually act on? Add or rename anytime, and let real transactions tell you what’s missing.$md$, NULL, true, 3
