SELECT c."id", 'Products, Services & Business Lines', $md$List everything you sell with a price, and keep each line of business separate.$md$, $md$List everything you sell with a price. Invoicing gets fast (pick the service, price fills in) and reports get smart (which service actually makes money?).

Run multiple lines of business? Keep their income separate — on Simple Start that means a separate income account per line (the Classes feature that tags transactions by line requires a higher-tier plan), and that’s enough to answer “which part is working?”$md$, NULL, true, 4
