SELECT c."id", 'Recording Transactions', $md$Weekly, same day, fifteen minutes.$md$, $md$Weekly, same day, fifteen minutes: open the Banking tab, confirm or fix each imported transaction’s category, add it. QuickBooks learns your patterns as you go. Send invoices from inside QuickBooks so payments match to invoices and you always know who hasn’t paid. Photograph big receipts in the mobile app.$md$, NULL, true, 5
