SELECT c."id", 'Social Media for Business', $md$One platform done well, and your first month planned.$md$, $md$One platform, chosen for your business (visual trades → Instagram, local services → Facebook, B2B → LinkedIn) — one done well beats two done badly. Set up the account with a bio that’s a storefront sign (what, where, how to book), then build the first month live on a simple weekly rotation: a finished job (before/after wins for service businesses), a tip, something about you, a review. Phone photos are fine. The bar: when a customer checks, you look current and competent.$md$, NULL, true, 4
