SELECT c."id", 'Google Calendar', $md$If it matters, it has a time slot.$md$, $md$If it matters, it has a time slot — including the admin work itself (“Friday 9–11: invoices”), not just appointments. Addresses in the location field so your phone navigates, reminders set by default, color-code by type. For meetings, send real invites — an accepted invite is a commitment, and a “see you Tuesday” text is a hope.$md$, NULL, true, 3
